Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 22:12:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 59/62] Gertrude's Cat: Fluffs' Stroke has its own reply;
 shorter shared hide

Stroke (op 3) ran the Pick-up handler. It now hisses with the wiki
transcript's Stroke line, "Perhaps the cat wants something?" (the
transcript only shows it before the milk; using it for every stage before
the kitten is returned is a guess), and purrs after the kitten is home.

Returning the kitten hid the shared Fluffs npc for 100 ticks. The cache
has no multinpc for her (3497: no multivarbit, no transforms), so the hide
is seen by every player; it is now 10 ticks so another player on the
quest is not locked out for a minute. OSRS's own delay is unknown.
---
